{"id":"3e21ee2923aace9a","group":"72","path":"72/72-lem-epsilon-0-notation.md","title":"Epsilon 0 Notation Lemma","display":"lem-epsilon-0-notation — Epsilon 0 Notation Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-lem-epsilon-0-notation","aliases":["72-lem-epsilon-0-notation"],"display":"lem-epsilon-0-notation — Epsilon 0 Notation Lemma","depends_on":["[[72-df-epsilon-0-notation]]","[[72-df-cantor-normal-form]]","[[72-df-recursive-order-presentation]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IV PA ordinal notation; local CNF order-isomorphism proof","verification_status":"source-and-argument-reviewed","proof_status":"proved-in-note","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-lem-epsilon-0-notation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-lem-epsilon-0-notation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-epsilon-0-notation — Epsilon 0 Notation Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"069c67d72b4fb710\" href=\"?note=069c67d72b4fb710\" title=\"72-df-epsilon-0-notation\">72-df-epsilon-0-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"eaeefe0a6812ba97\" href=\"?note=eaeefe0a6812ba97\" title=\"72-df-cantor-normal-form\">72-df-cantor-normal-form</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9cc4e14a96f221dc\" href=\"?note=9cc4e14a96f221dc\" title=\"72-df-recursive-order-presentation\">72-df-recursive-order-presentation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IV PA ordinal notation; local CNF order-isomorphism proof"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-and-argument-reviewed"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0},\\triangleleft,v,c,D_\\varepsilon,R_\\varepsilon\">\\(\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0},\\triangleleft,v,c,D_\\varepsilon,R_\\varepsilon\\)</span> 如 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"069c67d72b4fb710\" href=\"?note=069c67d72b4fb710\" title=\"72-df-epsilon-0-notation\">72-df-epsilon-0-notation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{otp}\">\\(\\operatorname{otp}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9cc4e14a96f221dc\" href=\"?note=9cc4e14a96f221dc\" title=\"72-df-recursive-order-presentation\">72-df-recursive-order-presentation</a> 的唯一序同构定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"v:\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0}\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}\\varepsilon_0,\\qquad\\forall a,b\\in\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0}\\ (a\\triangleleft b\\leftrightarrow v(a)&lt;v(b)),\\qquad\\operatorname{otp}(D_\\varepsilon,R_\\varepsilon)=\\varepsilon_0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[v:\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0}\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}\\varepsilon_0,\\qquad\\forall a,b\\in\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0}\\ (a\\triangleleft b\\leftrightarrow v(a)&lt;v(b)),\\qquad\\operatorname{otp}(D_\\varepsilon,R_\\varepsilon)=\\varepsilon_0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对项对的结构归纳，利用规范CNF比较定理证明字典序等价于序数比较，故排序条件正好是CNF条件。每个赋值小于某个有限指数塔，从而小于ε0。反向对α&lt;ε0作超限归纳：α=0对应空列表；α&gt;0的唯一CNF有限展开（把系数展开为重复指数）中所有指数严格小于α，故已有唯一子项。CNF唯一性及归纳给出存在且唯一。c由唯一素因数分解单射，故编码不改变序型。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-epsilon-0-notation","status":"resolved","id":"069c67d72b4fb710","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-epsilon-0-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-cantor-normal-form","status":"resolved","id":"eaeefe0a6812ba97","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-cantor-normal-form]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-recursive-order-presentation","status":"resolved","id":"9cc4e14a96f221dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-recursive-order-presentation]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-epsilon-0-notation","status":"resolved","id":"069c67d72b4fb710","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0},\\triangleleft,v,c,D_\\varepsilon,R_\\varepsilon$ 如 [[72-df-epsilon-0-notation]]；$\\operatorname{otp}$ 使用 [[72-df-recursive-order-presentation]] 的唯一序同构定义。","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-recursive-order-presentation","status":"resolved","id":"9cc4e14a96f221dc","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0},\\triangleleft,v,c,D_\\varepsilon,R_\\varepsilon$ 如 [[72-df-epsilon-0-notation]]；$\\operatorname{otp}$ 使用 [[72-df-recursive-order-presentation]] 的唯一序同构定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0},\\triangleleft,v,c,D_\\varepsilon,R_\\varepsilon","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{otp}","display":false},{"tex":"v:\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0}\\overset{\\sim}{\\longrightarrow}\\varepsilon_0,\\qquad\\forall a,b\\in\\operatorname{OT}_{\\varepsilon_0}\\ (a\\triangleleft b\\leftrightarrow v(a)<v(b)),\\qquad\\operatorname{otp}(D_\\varepsilon,R_\\varepsilon)=\\varepsilon_0.","display":true}],"bytes":1656,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-311","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-lem-epsilon-0-notation|lem-epsilon-0-notation — Epsilon 0 Notation Lemma]]"},{"id":"6b40e3ecfaa895b6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"1973566be420c068","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["069c67d72b4fb710","eaeefe0a6812ba97","9cc4e14a96f221dc"]}